@ Index:   Problem 5, solves rate, guess zero
@ Author:  Jaco Mostert, fm Duncan Murray's problem set
@ N 10, PV 50, PMT -30, FV 400, one period a year, starting rate 0.
@ Solves I%/a.
LBL ‘P5’
  10
  STO ‘NPPER’
  0
  STO ‘I%/a’
  50
  STO ‘PV’
  -30
  STO ‘PMT’
  400
  STO ‘FV’
  1
  STO ‘PPER/a’
  STO ‘CPER/a’
  ENDP
  I/a
  END
